atus_code or (resp_a.status_code == 200 and resp_a.text != resp_b.text):\n        print(f\"  *** DIFFERENCE DETECTED ***\")\n        print(f\"  user_a: {resp_a.text[:200]}\")\n        print(f\"  user_b: {resp_b.text[:200]}\")\n    print()\nPYEOF"}
